     .chezmoiignore

     Patterns are TARGET paths relative to $HOME, not source paths.

     Note: chezmoi already ignores every source entry whose name starts with a
     dot (.git, .github, .gitattributes, ...), so those need no entry here.
     ------------------------------------------------------------------------- */}}

